# ALLOW-LIST. This repository lives inside a much larger working folder (game
# extracts, Blender masters, renders, research reports: many GB). Everything is
# ignored unless listed below, so `git add -A` can never pick up game data or
# reports. To track a new file, add a `!/path` line in the right section (and
# `!/dir/` + `/dir/*` lines for a new folder). See AGENTS.md, "Git repository".
/*
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md
!/Run-PS4AnimationPipeline.ps1
